    "text": "1 days ago This article contains content summarized with AI. Learn more.\nvideo by @WGRZTVNews\nRecords show that the man accused of killing a woman and leading police on a chase along Walden Avenue in Buffalo has a criminal record. He was convicted of manslaughter at age 16 and released from prison last November. He remained on parole supervision after his release.\nAfter the recent incident, he now faces several charges and is being held without bail. The case has led to renewed discussion about prison reform and parole oversight.\n4",
